## Why This Is Asked

Assess how CKNE scores translate to practical controls in an API gateway, including per-tenant concurrency, circuit-breakers, and retry budgets, plus a simple scheduling loop and test plan.

## Key Concepts

- CKNE-to-resource mapping
- Fairness and SLA preservation
- Lightweight telemetry and safe preemption

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo minute loop
function ckneMinuteLoop(state){
  for (const t of state.tenants){
    if (t.ckne < 0.5) { t.concurrency = Math.max(1, t.concurrency-1); }
    else { t.concurrency = Math.min(state.maxConcurrency, t.concurrency+1); }
    t.retryBudget = t.ckne > 0.7 ? t.retryBudget : 1;
  }
}
```

